1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,300
The most expensive trade
usually isn't the loss.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,500
It's the one you take
right after it.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,000
You lose. You feel it.
Ten minutes later,

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,200
you're back in. Bigger
size. Worse setup. No

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:13,600
plan.

6
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,700
That's revenge trading.
The fix isn't willpower.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,600
It's a rule you set
before the loss happens.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,800
Here's mine. After a
full stop-out, I close

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,000
the chart for fifteen
minutes and write down

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,200
what happened first.

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,100
And any trade I take out
of frustration gets

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,700
tagged revenge trade.
Tag it, and you can see

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,700
what that feeling costs
you.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,400
Follow for more honest
trading habits.
